    "title": "Theme, Widget & Icon changer",
    "description": "<h2>\ud83c\udfa8 Tired of the same old icons?</h2> <p>Transform your home screen with <strong>Icon Changer Free \u2013 Themes & Widgets! \ud83c\udf89</strong> This app lets you fully personalize your phone by changing app icons, creating shortcuts, and choosing from hundreds of themes. Whether you love sleek, modern designs or fun, colorful styles, Icon Changer Free has everything you need to give your phone a fresh new look.</p> <h2>\ud83d\udd25 Features of Icon Changer Free:</h2> <ul> \ud83c\udfa8<strong>399+ Themes:</strong> From aesthetic, minimal, cute, to holiday themes, customize your phone\u2019s home screen to match your unique style. \ud83d\udcf1<strong>1000+ Icons:</strong> With tons of categories and a DIY feature, you can change icon colors, backgrounds, and even app names for a fully customized look. \u23f0<strong>Widgets:</strong> Add functional widgets like clocks, calendars, and more. You can even upload your own images for ultimate personalization! </ul> <h2>\u2753 Why Choose Icon Changer Free?</h2> <p>It\u2019s the easiest way to create a custom home screen with themes, icons, and widgets. Whether you want a pre-made theme or prefer to build your own with our DIY tool, Icon Changer Free has endless possibilities for customization. \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\u2728</p> <h2>\ud83d\ude80 Ready to Customize?</h2> <p>Download <strong>Icon Changer Free</strong> now and start transforming your phone today! We\u2019re constantly improving, so share your feedback at iconchanger.android@app.ecomobile.vn. \ud83d\udce7</p>",
